config ZT9101
	tristate "ZTopInc ZT9101 USB WiFi (350b:9101)"
	depends on USB && CFG80211
	help
	  Driver for ZTopInc ZT9101 USB 802.11n WiFi adapters, including
	  idVendor 0x350b idProduct 0x9101.

	  Firmware and driver options are read from the file given by the
	  cfg= module parameter, for example /etc/zt9101_wifi.cfg.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called zt9101_ztopmac_usb.
